  "title": "Persian Cucumber Yogurt (Maast-o Khiar)",
  "description": "This cool and healthy dip can be served along side rice and meat, or simply with bread. No Persian meal is complete without Maast-o khiar! This dish is best if refrigerated for a few hours, but if you are strapped for time feel free to serve after mixing.",
